<title>USA: ConSyGen completes Year 2000 phase.</title>
<headline>ConSyGen completes Year 2000 phase.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>ConSyGen Inc on Tuesday said it completed the automated conversion phase of its Year 2000 product, showing it is able to convert software code automatically.</p>
<p>In the automated conversion phase, ConsyGen 2000 was able to correct nearly 1.5 million lines of code for the COBOL programming language on Hewlett-Packard Co's 3000 system.</p>
<p>The so-called Year 2000 dilemma will arise at the end of the century when many computer systems will discontinue operating unless their internal clocks are adjusted.</p>
</text>
